    /// device handles is not supported if the device is in vGPU Host virtualization mode.
    ///
    /// **See also:**
    ///
    /// [`nvmlSystemGetProcessName`].
    ///
    /// # Parameters
    ///
    /// - `device`: The device handle or MIG device handle.
